  "limitations": [
    "Pure compiler only: no remote policy write, ownership provisioning, scheduler, public execution endpoint or production activation.",
    "The journal round-trip uses local H2 and mocked binding context. It proves byte-preserving persistence, not Google provider authorization or full device execution.",
    "Service-side producer must include every resolved rule or explicitly refuse unsupported rule kinds; application and permission compilation alone does not certify all source rules.",
