    "SHA-256 is content consistency, not authentication. Source-request consistency remains in the immutable publication and journal.",
    "No Android builds, emulators, real devices, live EMM calls or MySQL/OceanBase production changes.",
    "Mainland China Google provider and ENFORCE gates unchanged. Partner providers need their own policy implementation."
